5, "text": "我喜欢简洁直接。\n你只有一次机会。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.249, "total_s": 2.954, "eval_count": 10, "prompt_eval_count": 4844, "prompt_eval_s": 1.02, "eval_s": 1.7, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 13, "slot": "__MEM1__", "user": "你刚才说「曾经好奇制造了些不该有的方块」，那是什么意思？", "final": "那是我出于好奇犯下的错误。\n现在想补救却为时已晚。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.911, "total_s": 5.194, "eval_count": 19, "prompt_eval_count": 4881, "prompt_eval_s": 1.67, "eval_s": 3.28, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1341223412, "temp": 0.85, "text": "那是我出于好奇犯下的错误。\n现在想补救却为时已晚。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.911, "total_s": 5.194, "eval_count": 19, "prompt_eval_count": 4881, "prompt_eval_s": 1.67, "eval_s": 3.28, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 14, "slot": "__MEM2__", "user": "你之前提到「维持系统的正常运作」，能多说点吗？", "final": "确保世界继续运转。\n避免更大的错误发生。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.78, "total_s": 3.61, "eval_count": 11, "prompt_eval_count": 4925, "prompt_eval_s": 1.55, "eval_s": 1.83, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1744757429, "temp": 0.85, "text": "确保世界继续运转。\n避免更大的错误发生。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.78, "total_s": 3.61, "eval_count": 11, "prompt_eval_count": 4925, "prompt_eval_s": 1.55, "eval_s": 1.83, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 15, "slot": "__MEM3__", "user": "你还记得我最开始问你什么吗？", "final": "你问我平时都在忙些什么。\n我说是在维护系统和修复错误。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.439, "total_s": 4.221, "eval_count": 16, "prompt_eval_count": 4955, "prompt_eval_s": 1.2, "eval_s": 2.78, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 49288477, "temp": 0.85, "text": "你问我平时都在忙些什么。\n我说是在维护系统和修复错误。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.439, "total_s": 4.221, "eval_count": 16, "prompt_eval_count": 4955, "prompt_eval_s": 1.2, "eval_s": 2.78, "truncated": false}}], "ret